@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/users/{user_uuid}/actions/avatar_upload/invoke
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "Configure the file storage" as STORE
database "User name Workspace - What ? PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "It 's a transaction . outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact user scope" as TASK
participant "The worker pool ." as WORKER
database "The public events repository" as EVENT
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISP
participant "The customers Workspace" as WS
Client -> API: POST multipart with an avatar
API -> API: I 'm going to check . MIME/Signature and size
API -> STORE: Save bytes + public associated metadata
API -> DB: BEGIN; insert the file metadata + update the avatar
API -> OUT: add domain changes to the avatar/file
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON The user
API -> STORE: delete the replaced avatar if it doesn't have a link
OUT -> TASK: - Some of them . immutable delivery_snapshot_event\nEach one has its own outbox_event_uuid + exact scope
TASK -> WORKER: Read the last user
WORKER -> EVENT: Get ready to insert user.updated
DISP -> EVENT: Send/repeat/play
DISP -> WS: user.updated
@enduml
